@startuml UC54A_CountUnreadNotifications
!theme plain
title UC54A: Đếm thông báo chưa đọc

actor User as "Customer/Staff/Admin"
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Backend API" as API
database "Database" as DB

User -> Frontend: Truy cập trang / dashboard
Frontend -> API: GET /api/v1/notifications/unread-count\n(Authorization: Bearer token)

API -> API: Verify JWT token
API -> DB: Query notifications\n(filter: recipients chứa userId, read: false)\n(aggregate: count)

DB --> API: Total unread count

API --> Frontend: Success + { totalUnread: number }
Frontend --> User: Hiển thị badge unread\n(trên icon notification, navigation bar)

' ========== Real-time update ==========
note right
  Khi có notification mới:
  - Socket.IO emit "new_notification"
  - Frontend tự động gọi lại API
  - Hoặc Socket.IO emit "unread-count-updated"
end note
@enduml

